Package: kelixip-mod-registrar
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Emmanuel BUU <emmanuel.buu@ives.fr>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.ives.fr/
Depends: kelixip (= @VERSION@)
Description: Registrar / user-location module for kelixip
 The usrloc store: per-domain contact bindings with NAT/flow handling
 (received, flow, Path), expiry bounds and the save/lookup/subscribe facade the
 registrar scripts drive. Enable it with a [module.registrar] block in
 domains.toml.
 .
 The payload is BEAM bytecode, but the package is architecture-dependent on
 purpose: it must be built and shipped alongside the core whose embedded ERTS
 will load it.
